//  written-out километр below says [kʰilɔmetʰer]. The unit words are
//  listed here too, so both routes give the same thing.
//
//  Only the unambiguous multi-letter forms are listed. Single
//  letters are deliberately left alone: л is far more often the
//  emphatic particle [ɬ] than "литр", м and т and ц likewise, and
//  expanding those would break ordinary sentences to fix a rare one.
